@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### National monthly rates and territorial ranking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/comparison?year=2025&month=1

### District scope (same-year population; never join by names)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/comparison?year=2025&month=1&department=15&province=1501&district=150101

### Invalid month -> 400 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/comparison?year=2025&month=13

### No population for year -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/comparison?year=2010&month=1

### Multi-year monthly rates, with same-year populations and two peer departments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/history?fromYear=2024&fromMonth=1&toYear=2026&toMonth=9&compare=150000,070000

### Explicitly select no peers (the scope's historical series remains)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/history?fromYear=2025&fromMonth=1&toYear=2025&toMonth=12&compare=

### Rate map preserving all official count and geometry fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/explorer/rates?year=2026&month=9

### Invalid cross-level peer selection -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/history?fromYear=2025&fromMonth=1&toYear=2025&toMonth=12&compare=150101

### Advanced statistics: shared dates, same category nationally and territorially
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/insights?fromYear=2021&fromMonth=1&toYear=2026&toMonth=9&department=15

### District/category insights; reference windows can precede the visible range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/insights?fromYear=2025&fromMonth=1&toYear=2026&toMonth=9&department=15&province=1501&district=150101&category=Hurto

### Invalid range: 400 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/population/insights?fromYear=2026&fromMonth=10&toYear=2026&toMonth=1
